  "question": {
    "text": "An ideal gas has undergone through the cyclic process as shown in the figure. Work done by the gas in the entire cycle is ______ $\\times 10^{-1} \\mathrm{~J}$.<br/>(Take $\\pi=3.14$)<br/><img src=\"assets\\qt0002_c8a1dd22d126.png\"/>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "314",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0002_d72531b0b02a.png\"/><br/>Area of circle, $\\mathrm{W}=\\frac{\\pi}{4} \\mathrm{~d}_1 \\mathrm{~d}_2$<br/>$\\mathrm{W}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}(500-300) \\times 10^3(350-150) \\times 10^{-6}$<br/>W = 31.4 Joule<br/>$\\mathrm{W}=314 \\times 10^{-1} \\mathrm{Joule}$"
  }
}